      "worked_solution": "To estimate ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/3e196c5b200d5538850094f358f3c55d2631e745e813769d3be43035a9e866db.svg) we first find the two perfect squares closest to ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/1a4409994d80d42e52672c89d85bb2a11c557d555a38ad6d614b78bd78330b9b.svg)\n\nThe closest perfect squares are ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/8250f3d333487008c9f8ff6f21c2fcc3f67cc8b061380b5e4457a5f9a7353945.svg) and ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/b8b8cb2562d9c82f9c03088fc18d14d7750334c69cf803b535d79b1c73986b77.svg)\n\nSince ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/30ecc456cab2448c058eb3e738bdb4da96c41886e3a4ca451278ebf3792544a1.svg) we know that the square root of ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/cbc9c7a84ec901d819d33b39b58420fe3e7a6dbba88800a66fcfdc4da472ac78.svg) lies between ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/37e17c4a2302e6352fb7186621c9c43bb5e99d43a8a0bc700c0181d36c6cc915.svg) and ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/6a9cf85ae3a9cce8f2443a234fb1a16c612d847a446261ea740d93d5f1c468cf.svg)\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/f9d2536ecb1a4d163997e6415b21ff95094074c7fb521a535fc41d33bb0f0173.png)\n\nSince ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/cbc9c7a84ec901d819d33b39b58420fe3e7a6dbba88800a66fcfdc4da472ac78.svg) lies between ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/1418548